10 REM LOGIC GARDEN 125: THE COASTAL TURNAROUND
20 PRINT CHR$(147) : REM CLEAR SCREEN
30 POKE 53280, 0 : REM BORDER BLACK
40 POKE 53281, 6 : REM BACKGROUND BLUE (OCEAN BASE)

100 REM --- BUILD THE LANDSCAPE ---
110 REM SKY: TOP 8 ROWS (CYAN)
120 FOR I = 0 TO 319
130 POKE 1024+I, 160 : POKE 55296+I, 3
140 NEXT I
150 REM SAND: BOTTOM 7 ROWS (ORANGE)
160 FOR I = 720 TO 999
170 POKE 1024+I, 160 : POKE 55296+I, 8
180 NEXT I

200 REM --- SPRITE POINTERS ---
210 POKE 2040, 201 : REM DOG LEFT
220 POKE 2041, 203 : REM BOY LEFT

300 REM --- VIC SETUP ---
310 V = 53248
320 POKE V+21, 3 : REM ENABLE SPR 0 AND 1
330 POKE V+39, 7 : REM DOG YELLOW
340 POKE V+40, 3 : REM BOY CYAN
350 POKE V+23, 3 : POKE V+29, 3 : REM EXPAND X/Y
360 POKE V+1, 210 : POKE V+3, 205 : REM FIXED Y-COORD ON SAND

400 REM --- PHASE 1: WALK IN (LEFT) ---
410 FOR X = 345 TO 170 STEP -2
420   BX = X : DX = X - 45
430   GOSUB 1000 : REM XY LOGIC
440   FOR W=0 TO 5:NEXT W
450 NEXT X

500 REM --- PHASE 2: PAUSE ON THE SHORE ---
510 FOR T = 0 TO 800 : NEXT T

600 REM --- PHASE 3: TURN ---
610 POKE 2040, 200 : REM DOG RIGHT
620 POKE 2041, 202 : REM BOY RIGHT
630 FOR T = 0 TO 300 : NEXT T

700 REM --- PHASE 4: WALK OUT (RIGHT) ---
710 FOR X = 170 TO 345 STEP 3
720   BX = X : DX = X - 45
730   GOSUB 1000
740   FOR W=0 TO 5:NEXT W
750 NEXT X

800 END

1000 REM --- MSB COORD LOGIC ---
1010 MSB = 0
1020 IF DX > 255 THEN DX = DX - 256 : MSB = MSB OR 1
1030 IF BX > 255 THEN BX = BX - 256 : MSB = MSB OR 2
1040 POKE V, DX : POKE V+2, BX
1050 POKE V+16, MSB
1060 RETURN
